# The escalation gate: only org owners may change privileged.yml (org owners +
# org-scoped roles) or the CI wiring. Everything else (people.yml, repositories/*)
# stays reviewable by anyone with write — that is what the dashboard opens PRs against.
#
# Replace @your-org/platform-admins with your own owners team.
/config/privileged.yml   @your-org/platform-admins
/.github/                @your-org/platform-admins
